<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="152.4" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="94">Auxilliary AVR and video mux</text>
<text x="137.16" y="165.1" size="1.778" layer="98">Prevent AUX AVR from transmitting anything if the TX1/RX1 lines are in use by something else</text>
<text x="83.82" y="58.42" size="1.778" layer="98">RST and DIAG shared with main AVR
so that user can force reprogram of both firmwares</text>
</plain>
